  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續發展目標專題",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPIC ON SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT GOALS",
    "describe_ch": "聯合國在2015 年提出 17 項永續發展目標(Sustainable Development Goals, SDGs)之後，這份提及所有國家都面臨的問題之宣言已經成為世界各地、各行各業所依循的重大指標。學生應熟悉SDG的內容與精神，並在學習的過程中思索自行所學、專長能夠貢獻之處。此課程將帶領學生以現代科技、尊重環境永續發展的方式，與不同背景的同學相互合作、檢視並嘗試解決社會與環境的問題，透過相互配合、協調、甚至相互競爭、制約，彼此激盪而取得成果。",
    "describe_eh": "All United Nations Member States in 2015, provides a shared blueprint for peace and prosperity for people and the planet, now and into the future, known as 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development. At its heart are the 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), which are an urgent call for action by all countries - developed and developing - in a global partnership. They recognize that ending poverty and other deprivations must go hand-in-hand with strategies that improve health and education, reduce inequality, and spur economic growth – all while tackling climate change and working to preserve our oceans and forests.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
